---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base sidebar={false}>
  <h1 class="visually-hidden">Zarar Siddiqi</h1>
  <div class="home">
    <section>
      <h2>Build things <strong>people love</strong></h2>
      <p>I'm happy when people are happy with the software I make. It's because it's fast, self-evident and even solves problems that they didn't know they had. If you share that feeling, then let's build something beautiful together.</p>
      <a class="btn" href="/services/">Let's Start</a>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>Ideas, opinions <strong>and rants</strong></h2>
      <p>I mainly write for two reasons: 1) share things I've learned, 2) help me clear up my thinking on what I actually believe. I find writing to be cathartic and helps me clear up my thoughts.</p>
      <a class="btn" href="/blog/">Bloggity Blog</a>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
